            "status": "active",
            "contribution_type": "addition",
            "exact_contribution": {
                "added": [
                    "# Play tag. This helps them learn the game and get them really tired, simply tag them and back away, make sure you back out and try to get their attention....DON'T turn your back on them or they'll ignore you.<br><br>[[Image:Babysit a 1 Year Old Step 1.jpg|center|550px]]",
                    "# Explore their interests. Try to make them sit down and place two toys in front of them, if they grab a toy and plays with it for a long time, there you go! She/He likes it!<br><br>[[Image:Babysit a 1 Year Old Step 2.jpg|center|550px]]",
                    "# Keep an eye on them. You never know what will happen when you turn your back for like, 30 seconds.<br><br>[[Image:Babysit a 1 Year Old Step 3.jpg|center|550px]]",
                    "# Put them to bed. Going to bed, they HATE! Make them a bottle and read them a story or something.<br><br>[[Image:Babysit a 1 Year Old Step 4.jpg|center|550px]]",
                    "# Have fun. Whats the point of babysitting when it isn't fun? Have a blast!<br><br>[[Image:Babysit a 1 Year Old Step 5.jpg|center|550px]]",
                    "",
                    ""
                ],
                "removed": [
