                    "# [[Image:Babysit a 1 Year Old Step 2.jpg|right|300px]]Explore their interests. Try to make them sit down and place two toys in front of them, if they grab a toy and plays with it for a long time, there you go! She/He likes it!",
                    "# [[Image:Babysit a 1 Year Old Step 3.jpg|right|300px]]Keep an eye on them. You never know what will happen when you turn your back for like, 30 seconds.",
